{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>鄧凱文（Eris）昨日（15日）在社交平台分享了一段於機場拍下的搞笑短片，配文寫道：「POV: 當你看TVB大，去到機場就想當女主角…究竟我的男主角在哪裡？」戲精上身大玩經典劇集gag。</span></p><h3 style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'></h3><p id=\"p-rc_b3c36464072590b4-591\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>從片中所見，鄧凱文正身處機場離港大堂，她戲精上身變身做「TVB女主角」，似乎在找即將登機的另一半。她先是心急如焚地查看航班顯示屏，又雙手抱頭焦慮踱步、在機場大堂喪跑搵人，最後更頹然坐在地上打電話喊苦喊忽，眼神與肢體動作都非常入戲。最好笑的是，影片更配上了劇集《歲月風雲》的經典插曲《愛在記憶中找你》，相當貼合場景需要。</span></p><p id=\"p-rc_b3c36464072590b4-591\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"22c8e5f7-c673-400c-842c-5a8ae0f0f9b1.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026iy2nh1mzjD1789552788.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"22c8e5f7-c673-400c-842c-5a8ae0f0f9b1.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"3c587ec5-28cd-45c9-8061-18e4db9321c7.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026ifqprXK0qJ1789552788.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"3c587ec5-28cd-45c9-8061-18e4db9321c7.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><h3 style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'></h3><p id=\"p-rc_b3c36464072590b4-592\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>鄧凱文這天身穿一襲白色貼身無袖背心，配搭黑白格仔領帶及長褲，大騷纖腰與魔鬼身型。影片曝光後，一眾網民與粉絲紛紛留言激讚：「套衫好靚好襯你」、「演技好到位，搞笑得嚟好可愛！」</span></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-16T10:18:54.329443+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":340,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}